    <string name="app_desc">Ham Binary CoT (HBC) over a distance-vector mesh: encodes CoT events to compact HBC frames, routes them via announce-based mesh networking, and transmits them as audio (AFSK1200, OFDM, or Mercury HF) for VOX-keyed ham radios; received audio is decoded back into ATAK.</string>

